# Automation (see docs/PROJECT_RULES.md §9)

After finishing a task, stage relevant files, commit on `main` with a descriptive message, and `git push origin main`. Do not wait to be asked. Never commit secrets.

For Flutter web: use hot reload `r` / hot restart `R` on the managed `web-server` process (`frontend/tool/run_chrome.ps1`). Do not run `flutter run -d chrome` — that always opens a new tab. Keep a single tab at http://localhost:5555.
